{"content_hash": "85d4c099e1a47eaa", "version_id": 545, "article_id": 55, "level_code": "en_c1", "lang": "en", "level": 5, "level_label": "C1 高级", "title": "Solanke rescues 10-man Spurs with late equaliser at Old Trafford", "title_zh": "索兰克补时救主，十人热刺客场逼平曼联", "has_translation": true, "topic": "sports", "source": "bbc_sport", "source_url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/sport/football/videos/crz9zdl0g04zo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1590701722867-95e186ddbc24?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8M3x8c29sYW5rZSUyMHNjb3JlcyUyMGFkZGVkfGVufDB8MHx8fDE3OTE2NzgxMzh8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Weigler Godoy on Unsplash", "author": "Weigler Godoy", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@weigler?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/a-group-of-soccer-players-playing-a-game-of-soccer-JvccQap9IxQ?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(326, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(4, 46%, 48%)", "label": "SPORTS", "seed": "6686c357331f"}}, "published_date": "2026-10-10", "word_count": 241, "reading_minutes": 1.2, "lead": "Dominic Solanke struck deep into stoppage time to earn ten-man Tottenham a dramatic 1-1 draw against Manchester United at Old Trafford, salvaging a point from a bad-tempered Premier League encounter.", "lead_zh": "多米尼克·索兰克在补时阶段破门，帮助少一人作战的热刺在老特拉福德1比1逼平曼联，从这场火药味十足的英超较量中抢下一分。", "preview": "Manchester United appeared poised to claim all three points on home turf, only for Dominic Solanke to pounce in added time and snatch a shar", "preview_zh": "曼联原本似乎已稳拿主场三分，岂料索兰克在补时阶段抓住机会破门，为少一人作战的热刺抢回一分。这粒压哨扳平球为这场火药味十足的比赛画上句号——双方球员屡屡擦枪走火，两队防线在九十分钟里都难言稳固。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 535, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/55/en_c1.mp3", "duration": 89.062, "size_bytes": 538128, "engine": "edge-tts", "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural", "word_count": 264, "has_timeline": true}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@fc48a26/content/data/versions/545.json", "paragraphs": ["Manchester United appeared poised to claim all three points on home turf, only for Dominic Solanke to pounce in added time and snatch a share of the spoils for a Tottenham side reduced to ten men. The equaliser, arriving at the death, capped a feisty contest in which tempers repeatedly flared and neither defence looked entirely convincing over the course of the ninety minutes.", "That Spurs should emerge with a draw owed much to their resilience after going a man down. Rather than retreating into a defensive shell, they absorbed sustained pressure and exploited the spaces United inevitably left behind when pushing forward in search of a decisive second goal that never materialised, leaving the hosts to rue their profligacy in front of goal.", "For United, the dropped points will sting. Having seemingly done enough to secure victory, they were undone by a lapse in concentration at the most inopportune moment, a recurring frailty that continues to undermine their ambitions. The result leaves both clubs reflecting on what might have been, with Spurs buoyed by their resilience and United frustrated by their inability to close out the game.", "Solanke's late intervention, meanwhile, underlines his growing importance to Tottenham, whose attacking threat persisted even with a numerical disadvantage. Whether this hard-earned point proves pivotal over the course of the campaign remains to be seen, yet the manner of its acquisition will doubtless hearten the visitors, while posing awkward questions for their hosts."], "paragraphs_zh": ["曼联原本似乎已稳拿主场三分，岂料索兰克在补时阶段抓住机会破门，为少一人作战的热刺抢回一分。这粒压哨扳平球为这场火药味十足的比赛画上句号——双方球员屡屡擦枪走火，两队防线在九十分钟里都难言稳固。", "热刺能在少一人的情况下带走平局，靠的主要是韧性。他们并未龟缩死守，而是顶住对手持续的施压，并利用曼联压上寻找制胜第二球时身后留下的空当——可惜红魔始终未能打进那粒关键进球，只能为门前浪费机会而懊悔。", "对曼联而言，丢掉这两分必然刺痛。明明看似已锁定胜局，却在最不该松懈的时刻因注意力涣散而功亏一篑，这种反复出现的软肋持续拖累着他们的雄心。这一结果让两家俱乐部都不禁回味本可到手的结局：热刺因韧性而备受鼓舞，曼联则因未能锁定胜局而懊恼。", "与此同时，索兰克的关键一击凸显出他在热刺日益重要的地位——即便人数处于劣势，球队的进攻威胁依旧不减。这来之不易的一分能否在整个赛季中起到决定性作用尚待观察，但拿下它的方式无疑会鼓舞客队，同时给主队抛出一连串尴尬的问题。"], "body": "Manchester United appeared poised to claim all three points on home turf, only for Dominic Solanke to pounce in added time and snatch a share of the spoils for a Tottenham side reduced to ten men. The equaliser, arriving at the death, capped a feisty contest in which tempers repeatedly flared and neither defence looked entirely convincing over the course of the ninety minutes.\n\nThat Spurs should emerge with a draw owed much to their resilience after going a man down. Rather than retreating into a defensive shell, they absorbed sustained pressure and exploited the spaces United inevitably left behind when pushing forward in search of a decisive second goal that never materialised, leaving the hosts to rue their profligacy in front of goal.\n\nFor United, the dropped points will sting. Having seemingly done enough to secure victory, they were undone by a lapse in concentration at the most inopportune moment, a recurring frailty that continues to undermine their ambitions. The result leaves both clubs reflecting on what might have been, with Spurs buoyed by their resilience and United frustrated by their inability to close out the game.\n\nSolanke's late intervention, meanwhile, underlines his growing importance to Tottenham, whose attacking threat persisted even with a numerical disadvantage. Whether this hard-earned point proves pivotal over the course of the campaign remains to be seen, yet the manner of its acquisition will doubtless hearten the visitors, while posing awkward questions for their hosts.", "body_zh": "曼联原本似乎已稳拿主场三分，岂料索兰克在补时阶段抓住机会破门，为少一人作战的热刺抢回一分。这粒压哨扳平球为这场火药味十足的比赛画上句号——双方球员屡屡擦枪走火，两队防线在九十分钟里都难言稳固。\n\n热刺能在少一人的情况下带走平局，靠的主要是韧性。他们并未龟缩死守，而是顶住对手持续的施压，并利用曼联压上寻找制胜第二球时身后留下的空当——可惜红魔始终未能打进那粒关键进球，只能为门前浪费机会而懊悔。\n\n对曼联而言，丢掉这两分必然刺痛。明明看似已锁定胜局，却在最不该松懈的时刻因注意力涣散而功亏一篑，这种反复出现的软肋持续拖累着他们的雄心。这一结果让两家俱乐部都不禁回味本可到手的结局：热刺因韧性而备受鼓舞，曼联则因未能锁定胜局而懊恼。\n\n与此同时，索兰克的关键一击凸显出他在热刺日益重要的地位——即便人数处于劣势，球队的进攻威胁依旧不减。这来之不易的一分能否在整个赛季中起到决定性作用尚待观察，但拿下它的方式无疑会鼓舞客队，同时给主队抛出一连串尴尬的问题。", "text": "Manchester United appeared poised to claim all three points on home turf, only for Dominic Solanke to pounce in added time and snatch a share of the spoils for a Tottenham side reduced to ten men. The equaliser, arriving at the death, capped a feisty contest in which tempers repeatedly flared and neither defence looked entirely convincing over the course of the ninety minutes. That Spurs should emerge with a draw owed much to their resilience after going a man down. Rather than retreating into a defensive shell, they absorbed sustained pressure and exploited the spaces United inevitably left behind when pushing forward in search of a decisive second goal that never materialised, leaving the hosts to rue their profligacy in front of goal. For United, the dropped points will sting. Having seemingly done enough to secure victory, they were undone by a lapse in concentration at the most inopportune moment, a recurring frailty that continues to undermine their ambitions. The result leaves both clubs reflecting on what might have been, with Spurs buoyed by their resilience and United frustrated by their inability to close out the game. Solanke's late intervention, meanwhile, underlines his growing importance to Tottenham, whose attacking threat persisted even with a numerical disadvantage. Whether this hard-earned point proves pivotal over the course of the campaign remains to be seen, yet the manner of its acquisition will doubtless hearten the visitors, while posing awkward questions for their hosts.", "vocab": [{"word": "stoppage time", "pos": "noun", "zh": "补时阶段", "note": "指比赛常规时间结束后的补时，常与 in 连用", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "equaliser", "pos": "noun", "zh": "扳平比分的进球", "note": "英式拼写，美式为 equalizer", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "salvage", "pos": "verb", "zh": "挽回、抢救", "note": "常与 point、draw 等搭配，表示抢回分数", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "feisty", "pos": "adj", "zh": "火药味十足的、好斗的", "note": "多形容比赛或人情绪激烈", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "flare", "pos": "verb", "zh": "（情绪、冲突）突然爆发", "note": "tempers flare 是常见搭配，指脾气爆发", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "resilience", "pos": "noun", "zh": "韧性、抗压能力", "note": "体育报道中常用来称赞球队的顽强", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "absorb pressure", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "顶住压力", "note": "足球术语，指承受对手持续进攻而不失球", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "profligacy", "pos": "noun", "zh": "浪费（机会）", "note": "此处指门前挥霍机会，正式用词", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "rue", "pos": "verb", "zh": "懊悔、后悔", "note": "较书面，常见于新闻报道", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "lapse in concentration", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "注意力不集中", "note": "指短暂走神导致失误", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "inopportune", "pos": "adj", "zh": "不合时宜的", "note": "常与 moment 搭配，指时机极不恰当", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "frailty", "pos": "noun", "zh": "弱点、软肋", "note": "可指球队或体系的脆弱之处", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "close out", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "锁定（胜局）", "note": "close out a game 指稳住局面拿下比赛", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "pivotal", "pos": "adj", "zh": "关键的、起决定作用的", "note": "常形容关键时刻或重要比赛", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "title_original": "Solanke scores in added time as 10-man Spurs draw with Man Utd", "summary_original": "Dominic Solanke scores in stoppage time to salvage a point for 10-man Tottenham as they snatch a draw against Manchester United in a feisty encounter at Old Trafford.", "body_original": "Solanke scores in added time as 10-man Spurs draw with Man Utd\nThis content is not available in your location.\nThere was an error\nDominic Solanke scores in stoppage time to salvage a point for 10-man Tottenham as they snatch a draw against Manchester United in a feisty encounter at Old Trafford.\nMATCH REPORT:\nPremier League - Manchester United 1-1 Tottenham Hotspur\nAvailable to UK users only.\nSubsection\nPremier League\nPublished\n4 hours ago\